Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.32,Default,AdventurerA,0,0,0,,Not that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:12.40,Default,AdventurerB,0,0,0,,Help her! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:40.11,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:42.80,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:46.84,Default,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,Maybe it is, but I can't just do nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:47.52,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.24,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.32,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.03,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Don't butt in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:16.23,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Did you think you could just take my loot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:28.06,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,What did I tell you? \NThere's no point in helping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:30.70,Default,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,Just who {\i1}is{\i0} she, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:36.74,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,An oddball who shows up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.25,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,like the wind, literally,\Nwherever there are rare magical beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:41.76,DefaultTop,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:43.70,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,A freak who fights using \Nher mastery of bizarre tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:46.00,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,She may {\i1}look{\i0} sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:48.90,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,but she's a problem child \Nunlike any this kingdom's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:54.75,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,And that hair color she doesn't bother \Nto hide makes it easy to guess her status.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:56.64,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,That's why they call her...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:01.48,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,the plundering princess of the hunt:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:04.17,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,the "Marauder Princess."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:10.82,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:16.30,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, so I'll be taking all of the \Nmaterials from the beasts I killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.35,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:21.50,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,You saved us a lot of trouble, \NPrincess. We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:24.45,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's no trouble! \NI wanted the materials, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.45,0:02:25.65,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's win-win!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:30.04,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:32.62,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That means both sides come out on top, \Nso everybody's smiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:34.62,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yay, yay! Y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:36.59,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Ah, right. That is good, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:39.76,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Let's hope both sides come out \Nsmiling every time we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.47,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Sure! You can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:48.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Every magician should use their \Nmagic to make others smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:53.40,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's the kind of magician I want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:58.12,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,W-Well, thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:01.38,Default,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,She's an unusual sort of princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:02.58,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.44,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,She's royalty, and yet she's \Na high-ranking adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.66,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Some crazy kinda princess, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:12.61,Default,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,That, too, but if she's royalty, \Nshe could just use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:15.95,Default,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,So why does she use those weird tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:17.42,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:25.96,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,Because she...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.89,Default,Veteran Adventurer,0,0,0,,can't use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:33.98,Signs,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs36\pos(320,20)\c&H140900&\t(1608,1649,\3c&HFBFFFF&\bord3\blur2)\clip(116,16,126,73)\t(23,899,\clip(116,16,526,73))}The Magical Revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:33.98,Signs,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs15\pos(320,56)\c&H140900&\t(1608,1649,\3c&HFBFFFF&\bord3\blur2)\clip(116,16,126,73)\t(857,1649,\clip(116,16,526,73))}of the {\c&H7A4AE4&}Reincarnated Princess {\c&H140900&}and the {\c&HE38B59&}Genius Young Lady
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.98,Signs,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs36\pos(320,20)\c&H140900&\3c&HFBFFFF&\bord3\blur2\clip(m 116 13 l 113 58 325 59 325 36 305 57 119 54 120 14 223 16 196 44 192 6 360 15 330 43 331 5 535 5 525 55 497 54 527 17)}The {\c&H7A4AE4&}Mag{\c&HE38B59&}ical {\c&H7A4AE4&}Revol{\c&HE38B59&}ution
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.03,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,Regarding your upcoming schedule...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:43.77,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,As was discussed in the court council,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:46.11,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,there is a document seeking \Napproval for tax reforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.11,0:03:47.70,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:49.52,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:54.32,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,Prince Algard, if you would read it, as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:01.79,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,A-Anis—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:05.77,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Father! And Al! Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.25,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:09.70,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:12.35,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,How does one get so filthy \Nfirst thing in the morning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:14.95,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,You've been hunting for materials again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:18.40,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Have you no awareness of your role \Nas princess, you foolish girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.75,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! Please don't hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:24.04,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Corporal punishment in the name \Nof discipline is abuse! It's DV!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:26.50,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's illegal! Criminal! You'll be held liable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:28.61,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Forced to resign! The kingdom will suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.90,0:04:31.73,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:34.03,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yes! I argued him down! Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:40.39,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,That fool daughter of mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:44.67,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:45.50,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:47.46,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,The hide of a gray wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.39,Default,StatesmanA,0,0,0,,I've heard ordinary swords \Ncan't even scratch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.27,Default,StatesmanA,0,0,0,,How did she skin it so cleanly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:56.53,Default,StatesmanB,0,0,0,,The Mana Blade that Her Highness \Ncrafted is dreadfully sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:59.71,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,The study of magical science \Nthat Her Highness advocates...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:01.43,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,"Magicology," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:04.77,Default,Grantz,0,0,0,,It is indeed a thing to be feared. \NMost impressive of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.96,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:13.12,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,That foolish daughter of mine is \Nalways so bloody unpredictable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:16.73,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,Just the other day, she said she was \Ninventing some new magical tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.58,Default,Orphanse,0,0,0,,and then she burned down \Nhalf of the royal villa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:22.69,Default,StatesmanA,0,0,0,,Both His Majesty and the prime minister \Nare too soft on that insane princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:26.19,Default,StatesmanB,0,0,0,,Yes, but she did renounce \Nher right to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:29.25,Default,StatesmanB,0,0,0,,She can't cause any real harm \Nholed up in the royal villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.87,Default,StatesmanA,0,0,0,,But if that shady magicology \Nof hers gets around,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:34.46,Default,StatesmanA,0,0,0,,it may decimate the dignity of the nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:37.22,Default,StatesmanB,0,0,0,,Still, magicology could be of use to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:41.55,Default,StatesmanB,0,0,0,,If she actually has a knack \Nfor magic, it could mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:46.99,Default,Chartreuse,0,0,0,,Hmph. A simpleton who can't even \Nuse magic is nothing to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:58.73,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,You've really done it this time, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:02.00,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Well, some unexpected stuff happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:06.82,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,If you ask me, you yourself are an \Nentire bundle of "unexpected."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.57,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,It was when you were five \Nyears old, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:12.48,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,When you said out of nowhere \Nthat you wanted to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:22.35,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I had magic, I could fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:26.98,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,With magic... I could fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:30.32,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord2.5\fnArial Black\c&H97A5A6&\3c&H97A4A5&\frz20.12\fscx90\pos(188.666,174.666)\blur0.3}The Witch and the Flying Broom
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.07,0:06:30.32,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs20\bord0.7\fnArial Black\c&H97A5A6&\3c&H242322&\frz20.12\fscx90\pos(188.666,174.666)\blur0.3}The Witch {\c&HBDE2F0&}and the {\c&HD5D5DC&}Flying Broom
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:31.78,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs16\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H97A5A6&\3c&H97A4A5&\fscx72\blur0.2\frz13.74\pos(242.666,119.333)}The Witch and the Flying Broom
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.57,0:06:31.78,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs16\bord0.5\fnArial Black\c&H97A5A6&\3c&H242322&\fscx72\blur0.2\frz13.74\pos(242.666,119.333)}The Witch {\c&HBDE2F0&}and the {\c&HD5D5DC&}Flying Broom
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:44.76,Flashback,Ilia,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:46.33,Flashback,Ilia,0,0,0,,You mustn't run in the corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:48.92,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Let me go! I just remembered something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.50,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I have to ask Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:52.57,Flashback,Ilia,0,0,0,,Ask him for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.63,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,To use magic to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:03.92,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Ever since then, you've done all kinds \Nof reckless things in your pursuit of flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:07.86,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I did, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:12.29,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Just how many brooms have been \Nsacrificed for your cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:21.40,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,I sacrificed another one today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.75,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,I'll have to get a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:26.00,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,It's good of you to worry about the broom,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.08,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,but you should worry \Nabout yourself, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.16,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:32.52,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You're the only one who \Nunderstands me, Ilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:36.09,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand you \Nexceedingly well, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:42.30,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Fantasies about things like being able \Nto fly are very common during puberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:44.01,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Indeed, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:45.72,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, you don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.58,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,What will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:52.77,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,If you will be going out, \NI will attend to your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.77,0:07:55.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah, please do. I'm going to see Tilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.49,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,To perform an examination?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:00.08,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Nope, today we're discussing medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:01.07,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:02.55,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,{\i1}That{\i0} matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:09.29,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You've brought another enormous \Npiece of magicite, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:13.97,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Right? We should be able to make even \Nmore effective medicine from this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:16.17,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose we can try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:21.96,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You said you use this \Nmedicine when fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.38,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,The side effects don't bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:28.35,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,At most, you might get a little hyper, \Nand it might be a {\i1}little{\i0} addictive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.35,0:08:30.56,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,Your use of "a little" is hilariously scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:34.19,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You want to use magic so badly \Nthat you'd get your hands on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:37.01,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You really are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.82,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,There's no other way, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:43.85,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I was born without the ability to use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:50.83,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,And I'm royalty! Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:52.63,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It makes things kinda tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:56.93,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,I don't see the problem. \NMagic isn't that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:59.35,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:03.13,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Magic is fantastic! Magic is the best! \NMagic is romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:04.91,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,"Romantic" again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:09.43,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You're talking about absurd \Nfantasies like flying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:11.11,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:14.37,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Wait, "fantasies"? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:18.57,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'd say your doom-and-gloom hobby \Nof collecting curses is way more absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:21.02,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,Well, for me, it's just a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:23.68,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to do it \Nfor anyone else's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.39,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.99,0:09:30.71,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You're doing your research because \Nyou want to make people smile, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:33.43,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.67,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Jeez, where'd that come from? \NYou're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:39.47,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,I'd call that statement \Nan absurd fantasy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:40.27,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:42.26,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,So? Can you fly now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:45.95,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,No, I can still only manage low altitudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:49.99,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But if I increase the output, \NI think I can go higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.14,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I just shove in even more spirit stones...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:54.86,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But the safety measures \Nthat would require...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:58.61,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,What even made you think of doing \Nsomething so needlessly dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:00.20,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,as flying with magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What? Haven't you ever wanted to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:06.17,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You're a maverick princess in every \Npossible way, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:09.40,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,This kingdom's in real trouble \Nwith a princess like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.63,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What? I don't want to hear \Nthat from a noble lady
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:14.35,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,who went berserk and almost destroyed \Na marquess's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.33,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:17.02,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't worry about my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:19.18,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,We've got Al, so we're totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:20.92,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The royal family's in good hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:24.29,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I heard your \Nbrother's getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:28.98,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,What do you think of his fiancée, \Nthe genius daughter of Duke Magenta?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:30.01,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,She's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:31.96,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,That's all you can say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:34.87,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't really spoken with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.87,0:10:39.74,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,Oh? I thought the duke's family \Nand the royal family went way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.18,Default,Tilty,0,0,0,,You've never seen her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:45.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Well... I was pretty young at the time, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:08.96,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:36.64,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Oh, so herbal tea is all \Nthe rage in the castle town?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:37.18,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.87,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,We make it from herbs \Nwe've picked ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.87,0:11:42.84,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Really? I'd love to have some with you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:46.55,Default,Lainie,0,0,0,,What? Oh, but... it's really nothing special...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:49.92,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,Lady Lainie is with Prince Algard again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:51.24,DefaultTop,Algard,0,0,0,,I don't mind. The time spent with \Nyou is what gives it meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:52.75,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,Wasn't she born a commoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.27,DefaultTop,Algard,0,0,0,,Listening to your stories gives me peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:57.73,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,Yes. Her father was granted the rank \Nof baron for his distinguished service.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.73,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,Well, that is lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:04.08,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,But for her to spend all her time with \Npeople as high-ranking as the prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:07.85,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,Yes, not to mention that \Nthe prince is betrothed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:09.99,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,and he'll be graduating soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:14.56,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's merely being courteous \Nto Baron Cyan's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.07,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I think being considerate of school friends
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:19.96,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,is a very admirable trait for a royal to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.17,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:26.14,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,If that's what you say, Lady Euphyllia, \Nthen it's absolutely true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:43.45,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:45.90,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:50.40,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You really went to a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:53.56,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Everyone knows this marriage \Nis strictly political.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.84,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,What's the point of a tea party?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:13:00.34,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Formalities such as this are essential \Nprecisely because it is political.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:05.68,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,We need to build mutual trust \Nand knowledge of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.73,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,As the ones who will inherit the kingdom—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:12.03,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,As usual, you're so perfect, it's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:14.67,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I am merely trying to \Nfulfill my role as a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:17.09,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Hah. Nobility? Worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:21.55,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please refrain from \Nbehaving that way here at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:24.87,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,No, not only at the castle. \NAt the academy, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:25.83,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,The academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:27.66,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:33.85,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I said the same thing to \NBaron Cyan's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:36.68,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,but I would like you to \Nbear it in mind, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:43.81,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You and I are betrothed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:46.80,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,To avoid causing unwanted rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:49.28,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I believe you should choose \Nyour friends carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:54.85,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,As if we have the right to choose \Nanything for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:58.73,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,But your advice is valuable. \NI'll accept it with gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:01.95,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You can just let me choose \Nwho's worthy of being with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.89,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:07.75,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Do I really have to spell it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:10.87,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I thought a duke's genius daughter, \Nthe noblest noble around,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:13.38,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,would pick up easily on insinuations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:20.75,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:29.34,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Looks like we both wasted our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.27,0:14:44.65,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The brooms in the castle \Nreally are the best around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.60,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Just look at this! Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:49.07,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,You truly do love brooms, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:51.24,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:54.40,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I love them so much, \NI swept away my right to the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:57.04,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,No one is going to laugh at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:15:01.96,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A-Al! This isn't what it looks like! \NI'm not stealing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:03.79,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I was just cleaning the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:10.15,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That rebellious phase...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.85,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Weather: perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.32,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Wind speed: perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:17.77,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Gear: all set!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:20.72,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Safety checks: complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:23.30,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's the perfect night for experimenting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:25.39,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.39,0:15:27.35,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,It's quite cold out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:30.58,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Ooh, you're the best, Ilia! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:32.79,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Please remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.48,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,you mustn't go too high or too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:37.05,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,If anything goes wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.92,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I know, I know. You worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:43.45,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,Of course I'm going to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.45,0:15:46.31,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,I can't allow anything \Nto happen to our princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:49.77,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,and above all, you can't use magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:52.45,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,so if anything happens \Nin the air, you won't be—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:54.67,DefaultTop,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off! Have some hot tea \Nwaiting when I get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:03.26,Default,Ilia,0,0,0,,As you wish, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.78,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm really flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:10.19,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,My dream from my previous \Nlife has come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:25.00,Default,StudentA,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we made it to graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:29.79,Default,StudentB,0,0,0,,Yeah, really. I almost got \Nheld back for lack of credits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.24,DefaultTop,StudentA,0,0,0,,You're going back home \Nafter graduation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:33.31,Default,Male Student,0,0,0,,So this is our last soirée at this academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:36.47,Default,Female Student,0,0,0,,Indeed. We are graduating, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.76,Default,Lady,0,0,0,,So the rumor was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:43.76,Default,Son,0,0,0,,Yeah. Her personality's so \Noverwhelming that the prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:11.93,Default,StudentA,0,0,0,,Duke Magenta's daughter is here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:14.31,Default,StudentB,0,0,0,,What about the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.31,0:17:17.09,Default,StudentA,0,0,0,,The prince... Wait, that can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:21.23,Default,StudentB,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness! Look at who he's escorting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:36.87,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Everyone, congratulations on graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:40.51,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to have arrived \Nat this occasion with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:43.48,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,This is a joyous day for celebrating \Nthe start of our new lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:45.82,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,but there is something \NI need to say to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:54.83,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I hereby declare that I am calling off \Nmy engagement to Euphyllia Magenta!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:59.51,Default,StudentA,0,0,0,,The prince just called off \Nhis own engagement?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:01.30,Default,StudentB,0,0,0,,But why would Lady Euphyllia...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:08.66,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Prince Algard, why are you \Ncalling off our engagement?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:13.71,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I decided that you are not worthy \Nof being engaged to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:18.90,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You can make no excuses for the many \Natrocities you've committed against Lainie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:23.95,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If you're speaking of the advice \NI gave to Lady Lainie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:27.20,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I meant no ill will against her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:31.05,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Has the king agreed with your decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:33.56,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I'll get my father's approval later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:38.42,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,How could you call off the engagement your \Nfather chose for you without his consent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:40.05,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Who should I feel afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:41.72,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Times change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:44.22,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,I will choose my own path \Nat my own discretion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:47.89,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,But there are certain standards \Nto which you must adhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:49.91,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Please reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:52.23,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Have you truly become so blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:54.58,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You have the nerve to call me blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:57.36,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You are the blind one, Euphyllia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:19:00.94,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You want to be queen so badly, \Nyou refuse to see anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:02.58,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,That makes you unworthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:06.03,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Lainie has endured excessive \Nbullying, stealing, and harm—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.03,0:19:08.24,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,even plans to have her assassinated!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:13.44,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,And I know you were behind all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:15.92,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I've told you, I have no idea what—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.38,Default,Moritz,0,0,0,,I can testify.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:22.10,Default,Moritz,0,0,0,,We have witnessed the many evil deeds \Nshe has orchestrated against Lady Lainie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.77,Default,Navre,0,0,0,,Lainie may have been born a commoner,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:27.02,Default,Navre,0,0,0,,but the reprehension against her \Nhas been taken too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:29.04,Default,Saran,0,0,0,,Apparently, she forced her followers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.26,Default,Saran,0,0,0,,to harass Lady Lainie so that she \Nwouldn't get her own hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:37.44,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,What... is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:46.91,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I considered it my duty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:49.22,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I wanted to set an example for others,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:55.44,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,to be strong and righteous as the \Nfuture queen and a baron's daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.64,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Too bad, Euphyllia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:00.18,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Repent for all the wrong you've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:01.93,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,and apologize to Lainie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.60,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:44.45,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Ow... Total control failure...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:46.42,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:49.84,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh, Al! Hiyas!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:52.31,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:56.99,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Uh, did I... drop in at a bad time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:01.95,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Hey, c'mon, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:05.02,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Why are you waiting on another girl \Nwhen Lady Euphyllia is right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:06.40,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,That's none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:08.19,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Hey, no need to get so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:11.45,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Jeez, he's super pissed. \NTalk about scary. What's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:13.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Lady Euphyllia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.87,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So, uh, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:18.12,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Is she his prospective \Nmistress or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.71,0:21:31.42,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Wait, did he... call off your engagement?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:36.72,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh, man! For real? That actually happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:44.34,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,All right! I've decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.88,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'll take you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:10.19,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:14.49,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:17.40,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha... Wait! Please put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.72,0:22:20.69,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So anyway, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:23.81,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'll just take this little story back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.29,0:22:25.11,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:35.91,Default,Algard,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.35,0:22:44.41,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,W-We're flying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.41,0:22:47.35,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Welcome to your journey through \Nthe skies, Lady Euphyllia!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:51.86,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,The story you are about to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:54.93,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,is the story of two young girls \Nfrom a certain kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:57.98,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,The story of a princess who loved \Nmagic more than anyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:01.24,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,but whom magic did not love in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.51,0:23:04.12,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,The story of a noble lady
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.12,0:23:07.19,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,who was born with everything, \Nbut had nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.14,0:23:10.85,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,The story of their revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.85,0:23:14.36,DefaultItalics,Lumiere,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.46,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Um, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:19.72,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,To see my father and Duke Grantz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:21.05,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.05,0:23:23.72,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Because I'm the Marauder Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.87,0:23:28.21,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ask them to let me have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:29.39,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:32.43,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,What?!
